# Runtime league state - the draw, the reveal, submitted slips. Not source.
# A stray local click would otherwise land in a commit looking like the real
# league record. The draw's SEED is the durable artefact: it regenerates the
# order exactly, so nothing that matters depends on this file surviving.
data/keepers_*.json
data/keepers_*.json.bak
data/keepers_*.json.tmp
